WEBVTT

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.380
Momo, what are you doing in our house?

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:12.130
Ryo has summer homework to get done,
so I'm setting up the Internet for her to use.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.790
An "Inter-net?"

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.330
Hold on, you know how to construct stuff like that?

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.460
It's actually not very complicated.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.630
I'm just using the wifi signal that's coming from my room.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.880
The "wahoo signal"? Wait a sec...

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:24.830
Everybody say!

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:25.580
Wahoo!

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.290
Everybody say!

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:26.790
Wahoo!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.460
<b>Internet</b>

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:27.290
Sup y'all?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:33.040
Raise the roof! Wahoo! Raise the roof! Wahoo!

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:31.540
So you're saying that Mr. Internet will visit your house
if you throw a fun party for everybody?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:33.040
<b>Internet</b>

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:32.630
Not even close.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.960
<b>THE DARK WITCH RETURNS!</b>

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.960
<b>WITH STEAM FROM HELL!</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>CHANGE YOUR PASSWORD</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>Type your new password and hit the update button below.</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>Please use more than 8 characters</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>ENTER NEW PASSWORD</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>ENTER NEW PASSWORD (AGAIN)</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>Display password</b>

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.750
<b>Update</b>

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:11.960
What'cha doing, Momo?

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.290
Setting up the router.

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.670
What'cha doing, Momo?

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:17.790
Adjusting the parental controls.

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:20.500
How do you do that without looking at the keys, Momo?

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.580
It's called touch typing.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.830
I don't understand what any of that is...

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:25.540
Well, don't worry about it.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.920
I'm trying to focus here.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:30.380
Can you tell me the secret
to becoming a super hacker, Momo?

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:31.830
You're getting on my nerves a bit.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:32.790
HUH?!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:33.630
Done.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:35.290
It's all set up.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:38.170
Now you have Internet in your house, Shamiko.

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:39.630
Huh? Where is it?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:41.830
It's all around you. In the air.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:43.710
The Internet can fly?!

00:02:44.290 --> 00:02:46.710
So it's in the air...

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.580
You know, this reminds me...

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.790
Whatcha doing, Mikan?

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.210
Using Chitchatter.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>MUMUSHISHI43</b>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>I think I'm seeing more garbage in the river these days.</b>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>How can we get rid of it?</b>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>SEND DELISH FOODS</b>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>These wieners are really dang good. I just tried a sample at first,</b>

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:57.500
<b>but now I've bought tons and never get sick of them.</b>

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:59.670
It's a service that's kind of like a diary
where you post messages and pictures over the Internet.

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>THE 4 SEASONS</b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>Got my homework back. Half the answers were right</b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>and half were wrong. Kinda bums me out.</b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>I LOVE TAMA</b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>Tama's such a great place. It has just the right amount of nature.</b>

00:02:58.170 --> 00:03:00.330
<b>Plus, there's lots to do so I never get bored.</b>

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:02.880
It's a lot of fun because you can see
a different side to your friends!

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>HINATSUKI FOODS</b>

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>The Hinatsuki Wagashi store is open throughout the Obon holiday!</b>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>My precious daughter moved away to live on her own,</b>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>so our new treats are salt flavored to match my tears...</b>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>DOG WALKING LADY</b>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>I just saw a young girl running by the riverside</b>

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:02.920
<b>and hauling this huge tire behind her...</b>

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:08.330
Speaking of, Momo just refuses
to share her username with me for some reason.

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:10.000
You're saying Momo does it, too?!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:12.210
That's the impression I got.

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.210
Are you curious to find out?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:16.630
A side of Momo that I've never seen
is just lying around on the Internet?!

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:19.920
Then I need to find it, because that will
make it easy to understand more about her.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.420
Which means, I'll be one step closer
to putting a smile on her face!

00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:26.830
But you can't use it without having
a smartphone or laptop that can connect to the net.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.630
Plus, you'll need to register for an account.

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.420
Is that so?

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:32.250
<b>CLENCH...</b>

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:34.290
This is an opportunity that I can't pass up!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:38.500
I'm gonna get on the Internet and register
for that Chitchatter service and track down Momo's diary!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:41.380
Well, no time like the present!
I'm gonna start using this Internet thing...

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:41.830
Wait.

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:42.460
Argh!

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:46.250
How dare you! My tail isn't some kind of
emergency demon shutdown for you to yank!

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:48.960
Shamiko, you hardly know anything
about computers, right?

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.710
Sure, I won't deny I'm a total amateur!
But I know the basics at the very least!

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:54.790
There's no reason for me to take any lessons from you!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.920
Thanks for all the help, Momo. I have some tea for you.

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.080
Why don't you take a break, too, Yuko?

00:04:00.080 --> 00:04:01.080
Oh, sure...

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.000
All right.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:05.130
Since Shamiko sat down, it's time for...

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:09.580
<b>THE Internet IS</b>

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:09.580
<b>DANGEROUS</b>

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:09.580
<b>Produced in Cooperation</b>

00:04:06.170 --> 00:04:09.580
<b>with Ryoko Yoshida</b>

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.670
a Magical Girl Lesson on Net Literacy!

00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:09.880
You're totally prepared!

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:11.460
The tea's too hot!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:14.000
Mom?! Are you in on this whole thing or what?!

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:16.130
<b>THE Internet IS DANGEROUS</b>

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:16.170
That's just ridiculous. Don't be so paranoid.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:16.580
<b>THE Internet IS DANGEROUS</b>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:16.580
<b>Produced in Cooperation</b>

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:16.580
<b>with Ryoko Yoshida</b>

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>HOW TO DEFEAT A MAGICAL GIRL</b>

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>IN 5 SECONDS!!</b>

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>This is secret information meant for your eyes only</b>

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>** PLEASE CLICK HERE **</b>

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:18.920
<b>It's only available for the next 25 minutes, so be sure not to miss out!!</b>

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:18.960
Okay. Here's your first challenge.

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:23.040
You find a shady website offering information
that all demons would want and click on it.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>HOW TO DEFEAT A MAGICAL GIRL</b>

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>IN 5 SECONDS!!</b>

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>This is secret information meant for your eyes only</b>

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>** PLEASE CLICK HERE **</b>

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:23.630
<b>It's only available for the next 25 minutes, so be sure not to miss out!!</b>

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:26.250
But then, you abruptly find yourself
roped into a strange contract

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:28.540
<b>You must now transfer 18,000,000 Colombian Pesos</b>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:28.540
<b>within the next 3 hours.</b>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:28.540
<b>*If you fail to pay this amount, a Magical Girl swat team</b>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:28.540
<b>will be immediately dispatched to your location.</b>

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:32.670
<b>REGISTRATION COMPLETE</b>

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:28.830
and the administrator
is demanding you pay them big money.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:31.170
Why would that happen all of a sudden?!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.540
That's just how the Internet works.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.210
What would a demon girl do in this situation?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:38.290
Quickly make a call to the person in charge,
identify myself, and then apologize profusely.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:38.960
Wrong!

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:39.500
<b>Seized</b>

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.500
<b>YOU LIVE</b>

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.500
<b>CORRECT</b>

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.920
And now you're dead.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.330
I'm gonna die?!

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.670
If you're not careful, the Internet will kill you.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.540
That's so scary!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.750
Whenever there's something you want
to look up online, I'll just do it for you.

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:52.040
But that's a problem!

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:55.750
Because the main thing I want to do
is keep tabs on Momo's Chitchatter account.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:59.420
Let me guess, Shamiko.
You're trying to look up something sinister, aren't you?

00:04:59.420 --> 00:05:01.540
N-no I'm not! It's a violation of privacy!

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:05.080
Ah! Don't get me wrong, that doesn't mean
I'm trying to violate your privacy or anything!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:08.130
What I was trying to say is that
I want you to keep your nose out of my business!

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.750
So please let me have my privacy!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.040
Yeah, I got that.

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.750
Why are you being such a motormouth?

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:15.630
Whatever! Please just go home for today!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:18.710
Thank you and goodbye! Thank you and goodbye!
Thank you and goodbye!

00:05:19.880 --> 00:05:21.460
Are you sure about this, Yuko?

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.420
I'm fine! I inherited Dad's magic rod, after all!

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:26.880
I'm not the same demon girl I used to be!

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:31.960
I know Momo is more capable than I am,
but I don't need her to show me how to do everything!

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:35.210
But, you know, Momo seemed a bit lonesome.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:36.960
Also, before I forget...

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:40.790
Momo figured this might happen
and left this book for you.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:43.290
<b>The Definitive Edition</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:43.290
<b>A GUIDE TO THE Internet</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:43.290
<b>AND COMPUTERS</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:43.290
<b>THAT EVEN A BIRD</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:43.290
<b>COULD UNDERSTAND</b>

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.290
Darn her! But I better use it...

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:50.040
That's weird. The computer stopped working.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.710
Let's see what the book says... Um...

00:05:53.250 --> 00:06:00.130
"Start by pressing Control + Alt + Delete at the same
time on the keyboard to access the task manager."

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:04.460
"Then, you can select the application tab
and terminate the application that's frozen..."

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:07.500
Is this a magic spell or something?!
What the heck is an "application"?!

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:11.540
Some new variety of apple?! This instruction manual
needs its own instruction manual, dang it!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.830
Woosh~

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.080
Remain clam, my little descendant.

00:06:15.330 --> 00:06:16.250
Ancestor!

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:20.920
This is the perfect time for you to use
the all-purpose rod that your father left you.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:22.130
Great idea!

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.420
Yeah, just turn that baby into a hammer
and pound the crud out of the computer!

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:26.540
But we're borrowing it!

00:06:26.790 --> 00:06:30.170
Check out this big cart I'm pulling!

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.330
I did it.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.080
Whew...

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.250
I finally managed to sign up for Chitchatter!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.460
That took forever.
There were so many traps to overcome.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>POSTS</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>LIKES</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>FOLLOWING</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>FOLLOWERS</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>SHAMIKO</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>THIS ACCOUNT IS PRIVATE</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>I'm a novice demon girl.</b>

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>I'm determined to beat a magical girl.</b>

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:43.210
<b>FOLLOW REQUEST</b>

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.580
But it's okay! Because now I can move ahead
with my plan to spy on Momo!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:43.210
She's gonna feel so stupid for sending me her wifi signal!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:45.290
Take this! Diabolic Enter!

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.790
No way! Chitchatter has over
40 million users nationwide?!

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:51.540
I was such a fool...

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:55.420
I expected maybe 50 people at most
on this Internet thing...

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:00.000
Even if I looked through 100 accounts a day,
it would take like a thousand years to find Momo!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:03.750
Although I inherited this valuable,
all-purpose rod from my dad,

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:06.000
I haven't found a good use for it at all!

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:09.500
Are ancient weapons like this
just worthless in the modern day?

00:07:09.670 --> 00:07:12.670
No, that's not it! The whachamacallit rod isn't to blame!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.500
I'm the one who's worthless!

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:20.460
I thought finding Momo's Chitchatter would help me
better understand how she feels, but...

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.500
But, you know, Momo seemed a bit lonesome.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:28.580
Momo's feelings are hard to figure out!
She's gotta put them into words or I'll never understand!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:32.380
Dad! Please give me the strength I need
to overcome this!

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:34.170
Turn it into a hammer and use that to threaten Momo!

00:07:34.290 --> 00:07:35.830
She'd send me packing for sure!

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.790
<b>MUSCLES</b>

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:43.500
Shamiko? Why the fork?

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.040
I'm sorry about earlier.

00:07:45.040 --> 00:07:46.790
Huh? You don't have to be.

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:49.750
Pop.

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.670
<b>I WOULD LIKE TO KNOW</b>

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.670
<b>YOUR USERNAME</b>

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:51.670
<b>ON CHITCHATTER</b>

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:54.250
You're kinda putting the whachamacallit rod to waste...

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:57.790
I borrowed my dad's power to help communicate
something that's hard for me to say!

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:01.210
So, you made an account, huh?

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:01.920
That's right!

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.670
"Syadoumisutoresu"... you wrote it out in romaji, huh?

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:05.790
Yeah, I did my best!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.330
Why are you so interested in knowing
what my Chitchatter username is?

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.250
W-well, that's because I...

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.830
I want to find out what sort of things
would make you smile.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:19.330
It's so I can keep tabs on you all the time, obviously!

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:23.330
<b>MWAHAHAHA</b>

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:23.330
<b>MWHAHAHAHAHAHA</b>

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.080
I don't want there to be any weird demons
who get the better of you before I can!

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:23.330
<b>COUGH COUGH</b>

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:25.040
I'm sorry, Shamiko.

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:31.420
<b>ALPACRUNCHYSHRIMPOULTEEL</b>

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.130
It turns out I'm going to fall to the dark side
and become this demon's vassal.

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.960
Good luck throwing wifi parties on your own.

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:31.460
That thing's a monstrosity...

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:34.000
What emotion is your tail expressing right now?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.580
<b>Banda Terrace</b>

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:37.040
After all that, Momo didn't share her username with me.

00:08:37.630 --> 00:08:39.080
Snooooze...

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.750
Hey, Sis! You've finally launched your invasion
into the world of SNS, huh?

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.040
I'm really impressed!

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.790
What does "SNS" mean? "Super Net Space"?

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.580
Social Networking Services.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:56.500
<b>You have</b>

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:56.500
<b>one new follower request</b>

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:56.500
<b>Review</b>

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.000
Something popped up! What's happening?!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.540
It says "follower request."

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.920
Maybe someone wants to become
an officer in your army!

00:08:58.920 --> 00:08:59.460
Huh?

00:08:59.460 --> 00:09:01.380
But I haven't shared this account with anyone yet.

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:03.670
And I even locked it down just like Momo told me to.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.420
This is too shady! It has to be
some kind of evil envoy from the Internet!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:08.750
I'm denying it! No thank you!

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:09.500
I'm not so sure.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:12.880
Ryo. It's almost the time of night that monsters come out
to eat children who aren't asleep.

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:14.790
Grade-schoolers like you should be under the covers.

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:15.920
Okay.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:17.710
Keep up the fight, Sis!

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.920
Okay. Goodnight, Ryoko.

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.170
<b>@FreshP_032</b>

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.170
<b>has sent you a request</b>

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.170
<b>Please and thank you</b>

00:09:20.880 --> 00:09:24.170
<b>ACCEPT</b>

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:24.080
I just remembered,
Momo was looking at my account earlier.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.920
So maybe it's from her.

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.580
But wait, Momo said she didn't want share her account...

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:31.130
