00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.670
<b>Weightlifting / Cats / Udon</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.670
<b>12 years of service as a Magical Girl</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.670
<b>Going through rehabilitation after suffering</b>

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:33.670
<b>magic drain Wars are won with punches</b>

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.630
There's no doubt this is Momo!

00:09:36.380 --> 00:09:37.250
<b>Are you Momo?</b>

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.420
<b>Are you Momo?</b>

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:38.420
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.880
<b>Why did you share you account with me?</b>

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.040
<b>Why did you share you account with me?</b>

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:42.040
<b>Because I want to know more about you.</b>

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:42.420
<b>Why did you share you account with me?</b>

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:42.420
<b>Because I want to know more about you.</b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:43.670
<b>Because I want to know more about you.</b>

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:43.670
<b>Aha ha, just kidding</b>

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.250
<b>Aha ha, just kidding</b>

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:45.250
<b>I'm doing it to keep track of you</b>

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:47.210
<b>SNAP</b>

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:51.210
Don't think this means you've won!

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:51.210
Jeez, the walls are thin here.

00:09:51.170 --> 00:09:52.880
<b>ON ANOTHER DAY</b>

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.960
<b>Shamiko!</b>

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:56.960
<b>How exciting, you finally</b>

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.960
<b>made an account!!</b>

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.710
Shamiko! How exciting, you finally made an account!

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.210
Yeah! I did it!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.330
<b>Yeah!! I did it!</b>

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.330
<b>Shamiko!</b>

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.330
<b>How exciting, you finally</b>

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:58.330
<b>made an account!</b>

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.290
<b>Ah! I found Momo's account!</b>

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:00.290
<b>I just followed her~</b>

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.170
Ah! I found Momo's account! I just followed her.

00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.290
<b>Yeah! I did it!</b>

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.790
By the way, I had a lot of fun
seeing that movie the other day!

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.670
Yeah! I really enjoyed it, too!

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:09.210
I was on the edge of my seat when the zombies
grabbed the crab bomb and jumped into the sea of rice!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:11.000
So, are you free next Sunday?

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.710
Assuming I don't have any training!

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:15.830
Perfect! Then I'm calling dibs on you!
While we're at it, what hobbies do you have?

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:17.830
I'm cutting the wifi at night.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:22.670
Don't give up, Momo! Make lots of posts
on social media and put the "wahoo" into wifi!

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:35.380
<b>WHOLE MILK</b>

00:10:34.040 --> 00:10:35.420
What is going on?!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.170
Why am I being catered to all of a sudden?

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:39.170
They're bribes. No, wait, I meant to say offerings.

00:10:39.420 --> 00:10:41.750
I have something that I'd like to ask you today, Ms. Lilith.

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:44.790
Considering what I've heard from Shamiko's mom,

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:48.000
it seems that Mr. Joshua
took you around with him in the past.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:52.170
Do you have any memory of seeing my sister,
Sakura Chiyoda, during that time?

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.750
<b>WHOLE MILK</b>

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:54.630
Well, it may shock you to learn...

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:55.750
I don't remember anything!

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.420
<b>WHOLE MILK</b>

00:10:55.880 --> 00:11:00.420
<b>SWOOOOOOP</b>

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:57.460
Okay, then we're done here.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:00.420
Wait, don't take it away! I'm still eating!
Let me get a taste!

00:11:02.250 --> 00:11:06.580
Ever since I was first sealed away in the distant past,
I've continually grown weaker and weaker.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.210
The past 2,000 years or so have been the worst.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.960
My magic was so weak
I couldn't even observe the outside world.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:13.380
Huh?

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:17.920
Then about 10 years ago, my consciousness recovered
and I became able to see the world around me again.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.420
But my memories of the time
I was at my weakest are very vague.

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:23.130
Does that mean you've been trapped
inside that statue for 2,000 years?

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:25.420
Yeah, more or less.

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:28.710
But sometimes I would have good days
when I could pop into the dreams of my close relatives.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:32.540
And things have been pretty exciting
ever since Shamiko became able to hear my voice.

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.420
Enough with the sad looks! I don't need
any compassion from you whippersnappers!

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:39.130
And stop making silent offerings to me, it's freaky!

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:40.750
Shamiko! No more tears!

00:11:45.210 --> 00:11:47.710
Momo, is there something on your mind?

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.130
Huh? Uh, well, not really.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.460
Actually... no. Something is on my mind.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:56.920
I've been hurling Ms. Lilith all over the place lately,
and now I'm feeling kinda bad about it.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:01.420
Wait, I don't need to feel that way. Because looking back,
it was mostly her who provoked me into doing it!

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.540
Uh, yeah.

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.000
S-so hey...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.630
I think I have an idea.

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.750
What is going on now?! Are you torturing me?!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:14.630
I want to lend you my body again, Ancestor.

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:17.460
That way you can enjoy being free
for the whole day tomorrow.

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:22.210
I blocked your ability to swap your soul
into Shamiko's body after the last time it happened.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:27.040
But now I'm going to reverse that and remove the epoxy
adhesive by physically whittling it down to nothing.

00:12:27.040 --> 00:12:28.670
I knew this was torture!

00:12:28.880 --> 00:12:32.830
Rest assured, not a micron of harm will come to you.
The physical can overcome the magical!

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:36.330
I don't know anything, I swear!
I already told you everything that I remember!

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:38.330
Be quiet, I need to keep my hand steady.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:43.130
Please enjoy this image of lovely flowers in bloom
while Lilith is getting a very close shave.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.290
Welcome back, Ancestor.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:53.830
Momo already went home for the day.
We thought you fell asleep during the shaving procedure.

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.080
Don't be ridiculous, Shamiko!
That was me passing out from sheer terror!

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.420
Back when I was still a young lady,

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:02.290
I had an operation to fix a decayed tooth
with only a single drill and no anesthesia.

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:03.790
This made me relive that experience.

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.880
Wow, that's impressive, Ancestor!

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:07.500
Oh, I've got a message from Momo.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:09.460
It wouldn't kill you to console me a little more.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:12.130
S-sorry! It's just so hard for me to use this Internet thing...

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.330
<b>PEACHY PINK</b>

00:13:12.460 --> 00:13:13.290
Um...

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:19.290
<b>Hey, I know the plan is to let Ms. Lilith borrow your body</b>

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:19.290
<b>for the day tomorrow, but I'm worried that if we let her go alone,</b>

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:19.290
<b>she'll get lost somewhere far away and collapse from exhaustion,</b>

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:19.290
<b>or use your body to take on a bunch of debt in exchange for something.</b>

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:19.290
<b>So I'm going tag along with her to avoid all of that. Just a heads-up.</b>

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:18.040
Hey, I know the plan is to let Ms. Lilith
borrow your body for the day tomorrow,

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:22.170
but I'm worried that if we let her go alone she'll get lost
somewhere far away and collapse from exhaustion,

00:13:19.290 --> 00:13:21.750
<b>Tama Crossroad</b>

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.710
<b>IOU</b>

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.710
<b>IOU</b>

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.710
<b>IOU</b>

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:25.710
<b>IOU</b>

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.580
or use your body to take on a bunch of debt
in exchange for something.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.920
"So I'm going to tag along with her
to avoid all of that. Just a heads-up."

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.040
That's what it says.

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.040
What?! I don't need her to come with me!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:35.000
Does she think I'm a dum-dum demon
who can't find her way out of a paper bag?!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.880
I'm perfectly capable of going on a walk alone!

00:13:36.880 --> 00:13:39.790
But are you sure you can figure out
how to reach the hot springs?

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:41.710
Plus, you have to pay to get in and all that.

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.130
I have no idea, but I'll get there one way or the other.

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:50.330
<b>HOT SPRING</b>

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:47.500
Then all I have to do is beg profusely and they'll let me in
even if I'm strapped for cash, right?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:50.330
Yeah, I'm starting to think you should just go with Momo.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.460
Ancestor?

00:13:54.000 --> 00:14:01.460
<b>WHOLE MILK</b>

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:58.460
I've been concerned for a while
that you and Momo keep squabbling with each other.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:01.500
I'd be happy if you used this opportunity
to get on more friendly terms with her.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.920
Although its temporary, we're working together now.

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.170
Well, if it's that important to you...

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.960
but if Momo is going to be my escort for the day,
then we have to make it clear that I'm the boss!

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:13.080
The way she wrote this message
was pretty patronizing towards me!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:16.500
So I'm going to have to throw her off
by asserting my dominance right from the get-go!

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:17.670
You think so?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.380
<b>LAST SUMMER SALE 50% OFF!</b>

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.670
I know just what to do.

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:24.790
<b>GLOOOOM</b>

00:14:26.830 --> 00:14:27.960
I have arrived!

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:36.540
Bow before the dark witch, Lilith!
I'm here in the body of my young descendant!

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:39.750
Oh dear, I'm sorry.

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.420
Calm down, boy! No barking.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.540
Momo, thanks for helping my ancestor today.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.460
I hope the two of you can learn how to get along better.

00:14:48.460 --> 00:14:52.170
Yes, indeed. I'm going to fill Shamiko's usual role
and hang out with you for the day!

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:54.250
I'll be using this time to do some studying.

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.880
You two go on and enjoy yourselves.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:59.670
Great! I'll shut out all the noise from outside the statue
so you can just take it easy!

00:14:59.670 --> 00:15:00.080
Huh?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.830
Consider yourself fortunate to have the honor
of escorting the great dark witch, Lilith!

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.830
Ms. Lilith, you mismatched your socks.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:08.540
It's called being fashionable!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.500
<b>LAST SUMMER SALE 50% OFF!</b>

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:10.460
This is perfect!

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:14.130
We can buy a hip outfit for me to wear
so that I can totally catch Momo off guard!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.250
Wait, buy it right now?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:18.710
This page says they ship immediately.
So it'll probably get here in time!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:21.380
Yeah, get that! And this one looks like
it has good attack power!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:22.750
Oh, throw that one in, too!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.080
Hold on, Ancestor! The price of our cart
is going through the roof!

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:29.210
You're inexperienced, so I'm sure you don't know.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:33.500
But if you play your cards right with online shopping,
then you can get whatever you buy for absolutely free!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.000
I've done the research!

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:36.250
Is that true?!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:40.580
Yep! There's stuff like sign-up bonuses,
whachahoozit payment and cash on such-and-such.

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.040
It's a whole complicated system, but the main point
is you can forget about money for the time being!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.630
Which means it's as good as free!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.920
You really know your stuff, Ancestor!

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.080
It is not actually free.

00:15:47.080 --> 00:15:48.330
<b>WARNING: IT IS NOT ACTUALLY FREE</b>

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:51.290
<b>PURCHASE WITH DEFERRED PAYMENT</b>

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:49.670
Now, click away!

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:50.420
Clicking now!

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:53.130
Are you shocked?

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:56.920
Ugh. I just wanna put her in a stranglehold,
but I can't because that's actually Shamiko's body.

00:15:57.670 --> 00:15:59.830
This sucks. I don't want to walk next to you.

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:06.170
<b>CAT JAMBOREE</b>

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:02.210
Oh? Are you spooked? Scared senseless?

00:16:02.210 --> 00:16:04.790
Not really. It's more like you stand out way too much.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.210
Like all eyes are on us right now.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.130
It's because I make this look devilishly good!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:10.500
You're a fool for not understanding my genius!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.130
Besides, what even is that pathetic outfit you have on?!

00:16:13.130 --> 00:16:13.790
I felt lazy.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.130
Well you look like a loser!

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.080
You should've sucked it up

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.920
and come in the white garbs of repentance
to apologize for all the crap you put me through!

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:21.170
It was a mistake to come.

00:16:21.170 --> 00:16:26.790
<b>GLOOOOOOOM</b>

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.920
Well, I do appreciate you acting as my guide.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:26.750
By the way, do you understand
the significance of this weather?

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:31.000
Is it all the worst aspects of your personality
manifesting on a physical plane?

00:16:31.000 --> 00:16:31.750
NO!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:35.880
The old ancestor switch
required good weather to have any effect.

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:40.210
But now, I can use it to transfer over
to Shamiko's body even in bad weather!

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:44.170
Guess what? That means Shamiko's magic powers
are growing stronger by the day!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:47.670
All thanks to some half-brained magical girl
who keeps training her on a daily basis!

00:16:47.920 --> 00:16:49.790
Neener! Neener!

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.080
Gotta restrain myself...

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:54.830
I could judo throw her to the moon and back,
but Shamiko is the one who will suffer the pain.

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.630
Why hello there, Shamiko!

00:16:58.170 --> 00:17:04.210
<b>CAT JAMBOREE</b>

00:16:58.210 --> 00:17:00.080
Oh, uh... Hello Ogura.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:02.710
I was just out gathering some new specimens!

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:03.710
Wanna see what I got?

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:08.210
Oh? Are you sure?
Aren't you curious? I know you must be!

00:17:08.210 --> 00:17:08.880
Wait...

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:14.830
Oh.

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:19.460
Well, I haven't finished gathering everything I need yet.
So I'll see you two later!

00:17:19.460 --> 00:17:22.750
But I think I've got a great idea brewing... Hehehe...

00:17:22.750 --> 00:17:25.830
Shamiko's current magic level only allows me
to use her body for 2 or 3 hours max.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:29.830
C'mon, Magical Girl! We're using the local bus route
to reach the Beppu hot springs!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.750
You'll run out of time just waiting for the bus.

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:32.580
Wah!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:35.000
What about the Gero hot spring? Or Noboribetsu?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:38.460
<b>Gero</b>

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:38.460
<b>Noboribetsu</b>

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:38.460
<b>Beppu</b>

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:38.460
<b>Tama</b>

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.000
All too far away.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.380
No fair, no fair, no fair, I wanna take a dip!

00:17:38.540 --> 00:17:40.420
I love hot springs!

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.460
You just won't budge on that will you?

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.420
<b>TAMA HEALTH SPA</b>

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:44.380
Okay, here we are.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.380
Yeah, been here before. This is the second time.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.080
Momo, this place is old news. But I guess it's okay.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.250
I wanna bail so bad...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:58.460
<b>TICKET MACHINE</b>

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:58.460
<b>HOT SPRINGS</b>

00:17:51.710 --> 00:17:53.290
Ms. Lilith, you need 1,010 yen.

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:55.130
I thought you were treating me
in honor of all my service?!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.460
Nah, this is just a casual meet up.

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.500
Wouldn't you feel pathetic to let
a bratty kid cover your bill?

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:00.920
Look, I don't have any money in my wallet.

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:05.080
That's SHAMIKO's wallet, thank you very much.
Everybody pays their fair share in casual meet ups!

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:08.830
So, here's the deal.
You'll earn 20 yen for every rep you finish.

00:18:08.830 --> 00:18:10.790
What is this, some sort of torture device?!

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.210
It's a butterfly machine.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.330
I'm only here for the hot springs...

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:17.380
I don't care about exercise or the gym room
even the... tiniest smidge...!

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:19.130
Fruity milk for 120 yen!

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:21.040
Sweet! I'm doing six more right now!

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:26.290
Oh crap! Shamiko's magic is starting to run low!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.130
We gotta hurry for the baths, Magical Girl!

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:28.790
Go ahead.

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:32.580
I'll just be waiting for you outside.
You don't mind going alone, right?

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:33.670
But why?!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.670
We should soak in the hot bath until we feel lightheaded,

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.080
then just let all the sweat
and hard feelings between us wash away!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:43.960
This reminds me, the last time we came here
you just kept watch from outside the whole time.

00:18:43.960 --> 00:18:46.880
Plus, you used that strange wand to transform
your clothes without actually getting undressed.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:51.290
Let me guess! You're too shy to get naked, aren't you!

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.080
Uh, no, it's just too much of a hassle.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:56.290
You always seem so cool and composed,
but you're a real gentle maiden at heart, huh?

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:57.380
You've got the wrong idea.

00:18:57.380 --> 00:18:59.460
All right! How wonderful! You've piqued my interest!

00:18:59.460 --> 00:19:00.670
Strip! Take it all off!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:07.630
<b>TAMA HEALTH SPA</b>

00:19:00.670 --> 00:19:01.580
I'll have to pass.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:05.460
Just give me the chance to see your vulnerable side,
then I'll always feel genuinely superior to you!

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:07.630
Scratch that. I mean I'll always feel good
about fighting by your side!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:12.250
I'm going to commit every little detail of this to memory,
so let's get this humiliation show on the road!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.500
Strip! And then feel the shame, Magical Girl!

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:22.080
Attention guests, we are currently experiencing
a blackout due to extreme weather.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:23.540
Oh, it's just a power outage.

00:19:23.790 --> 00:19:26.170
Good timing, let's go wait in the lobby for now.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:29.250
Momomomomo! What's going on?! Is the world ending?!

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:32.000
Shamiko? Oops, I mean, Ms. Lilith. Are you okay?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:33.710
Well, actually...

00:19:33.710 --> 00:19:36.080
I can't handle being in complete darkness!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:39.630
I need you to pick me up and get out of here ASAP!
I'm terrified of pure darkness!

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:42.130
Even though you're the witch
who governs over eternal darkness?

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:46.330
Around the time that I got sealed away,
I was still fairly inept at magic.

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:50.500
So the space inside of the statue was pitch-black
until I learned how to control my magic power.

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:53.210
I wasn't even able to see the outside world...

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:55.830
Huh?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.960
Does this make you feel better?

00:19:57.960 --> 00:20:01.500
Is that one of those smartphone thingies?
Y-yeah! I can bear through it if we have this!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:03.130
Okay, then until the power comes back on...

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.290
<b>Narrow Pushups             5 Times</b>

00:20:03.130 --> 00:20:05.290
<b>Arm Toning + Weight Training</b>

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:07.960
This video will help to train your biceps.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:10.750
And this video will help to shape your gluteus maximus.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:11.920
Wow...

00:20:11.920 --> 00:20:13.460
What is happening right now?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:18.830
I feel alive again! Thanks for coming with me.

00:20:18.830 --> 00:20:19.380
Sure.

00:20:21.710 --> 00:20:23.960
Are those all scars you've got there?

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:26.710
Oh, yeah. I'm not really
embarrassed by them or anything.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:30.250
Injuries that get sustained while fighting
in ether-bodies usually leave a scar behind.

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:34.080
A lot happened after my sister disappeared
and it's kind of annoying to explain...

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.210
Then I won't bother asking.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:37.380
I hope I didn't sour the mood.

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:39.750
This is nothing compared to your usual shenanigans.

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:47.290
Wowee! The suds just keep building! I had no idea
fancy shampoo made this many bubbles!

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:49.290
<b>TAMA HEALTH SPA</b>

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:52.000
Walking around in these clothes is humiliating...

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.250
Did you enjoy the health spa, Ancestor?

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.630
Indeed! We did have some trouble here and there.

00:20:57.630 --> 00:21:00.040
But I had a good time dragging Momo to Hell and back!

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:00.750
That's nice.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:03.250
Speaking of which, when we were in the bath I saw...

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:04.380
Never mind.

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:08.250
Momo went out of her way to take care of me.
She's a good person.

00:21:08.670 --> 00:21:10.000
I'm glad to hear that!

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:11.920
I'll let you borrow my body again sometime.

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:15.380
To be honest, I actually kind of like
being carried around by you like this.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:16.380
Oh really?

00:21:16.460 --> 00:21:20.750
Anyways, those smartphone things are amazing!
Such a lifesaver!

00:21:20.750 --> 00:21:22.330
You should get one, too!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.920
Shamiko, can I have a quick chat with Ms. Lilith?

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:25.920
Uh, sure.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:28.540
Please listen to this, Ms. Lilith.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:30.960
I'm terrified of pure darkness!

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.960
I'm terrified of pure darkness!

00:21:32.960 --> 00:21:34.920
I'm terrified of pure darkness!

00:21:33.420 --> 00:21:34.920
H-how did you...?

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.500
Smartphones these days are so useful
we can even record sound with them.

00:21:37.790 --> 00:21:40.670
You and your little schemes
have given me a ton of grief up until today,

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.830
but now I've got the blackmail I need to keep you in line.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:45.960
I mean, who could believe that you,
the great witch who governs over eternal darkness,

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:47.540
suffers from nyctophobia of all things?

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:50.330
You don't want your cute little descendant
to find out, do you?

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:52.210
No... no!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:55.040
Unless you want me to start
wreaking havoc with this recording,

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:58.540
then I suggest you behave yourself
until we've sorted out all of our mutual matters.

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.960
Curses, since when do magical girls play so dirty...!

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.670
They're whispering to each other like good friends!

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:08.630
I never thought they'd get along so well.
I'm glad they had this outing today!

00:22:09.210 --> 00:22:14.080
Don't give up, Shamiko! And be prepared to suffer
from some extremely sore muscles tomorrow.

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:26.000
<b>BILL</b>

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:20.040
Nothing is "as good as free"!

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.460
The next time you pull a stunt like this,
I'm putting you up in an online auction!

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:26.040
Glub... glub... I'm sorry...

00:23:56.080 --> 00:24:11.040
<b>PREVIEW</b>

00:23:57.210 --> 00:23:59.170
Let's go into town and search for demons today.

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:00.790
We need to find the places they live.

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.920
But I have no idea where those might be,
so I'm going to ask Anri!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:06.170
Yeah, I know a place you can always
find demons hanging around!

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:07.790
Time to go down the demon hole!

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:11.040
<b>A NEW SPECIES DISCOVERED! THE TOWN CAFE IS A DEMON LAIR!</b>

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:10.710
Shamiko, pick up ingredients
for dinner on your way home, okay?
